  "description": "Moe's Original BBQ is an authentic Alabama-style BBQ restaurant chain serving slow-smoked pulled pork, ribs, chicken, and house-made sauces across 40+ locations in the Southeast and beyond. Moe's Original BBQ Foley is a highly rated barbecue restaurant in Foley, Alabama, serving authentic Alabama-style BBQ, slow-smoked meats, and classic Southern sides with genuine hospitality. The restaurant serves pulled pork, smoked chicken, St. Louis-style ribs, and smoked wings paired with homemade Southern sides like baked beans, mac and cheese, potato salad, and banana pudding—all made fresh daily. Beyond great food, Moe's Foley is also a local hotspot for entertainment, featuring live music, weekly trivia nights, and bingo.",
